WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.487
Most kids finish a story and say: it was good.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:07.777
So Mr. Jay asks one question: why did she do that?

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:12.560
Now your child has to look for a clue, and explain it in English.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.510
That's thinking, not just reading.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.555
Was she scared?

00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:17.817
Was she being kind?

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.392
Your child decides, then proves it with something from the story.

00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:24.156
Try it tonight with any story.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:25.381
Just ask: why?

00:00:26.402 --> 00:00:27.752
Want a free story game?

00:00:27.752 --> 00:00:30.502
Message Mr. Jay on Zalo: VIDEO.

